    "%@: a %@ subscription for %@ a %@. Payment is charged to your Apple Account when you confirm the purchase. It renews automatically at the same price unless you turn off auto-renew at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. Manage or cancel it anytime in your Apple Account settings." : {
